---
import { getEntry, render } from 'astro:content';
import MainLayout from './../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import PuzzleSection from './../components/PuzzleSection.astro';
import TimelineItem from './../components/TimelineItem.astro'; // <--- DODANO IMPORT

const entry = await getEntry('docs', 'en');
if (!entry) return Astro.redirect('/404');
const { Content, headings } = await render(entry);
---

<MainLayout title={entry.data.title} headings={headings}>
  
  <PuzzleSection title="O mnie" image="/images/programmer-grinding.png" layout="stacked">
    <p>
I started my journey in IT back in 2018... but first, a bit about me — so you can get a sense of who I am and how I think.

Since childhood, I’ve been interested in foreign languages, chess, and a healthy lifestyle. I feel that the curiosity behind it all is really a drive to learn and optimize. I’ve achieved several successes in chess, and I also manage to maintain a healthy lifestyle despite having a sedentary job.

I’m an open-minded, confident, and ambitious person; I’m motivated by challenging tasks and I’m eager to take them on. I’m creative and able to work independently. I’m interested in IT — from backend, through DevOps, to frontend — and AI-related topics are familiar to me. I continuously develop my skills in all of these areas, as shown by my projects on GitHub.
    </p>
  </PuzzleSection>

  <!-- CONNECTOR -->
<div class="relative h-16 flex items-center justify-center">

  <!-- vertical line -->
  <div class="absolute top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-slate-300 opacity-40"></div>

  <!-- node -->
  <div class="w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-slate-900 rounded-full relative z-10">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 scale-150 border border-slate-400 rounded-full opacity-40"></div>
  </div>

</div>

  <PuzzleSection title="Moje cele" image="/images/learning-technologies.png" reverse={false} layout="image-heavy">
  <p>
  In life, I value precision. I focus on learning carefully selected technologies that I consider both highly valuable and forward-looking.
</p>
<ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
  <li>Strong understanding and proficiency in Kubernetes and Terraform</li>
  <li>Efficient, lightweight, and well-crafted frontend</li>
  <li>Backend and database tailored to real needs</li>
  <li>Building practical and useful online products</li>
</ul>
  </PuzzleSection>

<!-- CONNECTOR -->
<div class="relative h-16 flex items-center justify-center">

  <!-- vertical line -->
  <div class="absolute top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-slate-300 opacity-40"></div>

  <!-- node -->
  <div class="w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-slate-900 rounded-full relative z-10">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 scale-150 border border-slate-400 rounded-full opacity-40"></div>
  </div>

</div>

  <PuzzleSection title="Doświadczenie" image="/images/gaining-experience.png">
    <!-- Tutaj wstawiamy Timeline zamiast zwykłego <p> -->
    <div class="mt-6">
<TimelineItem 
  date="2026[October] - Present"
  title="DevOps (German-speaking)"
  company="Capgemini"
  description="Working on a project"
/>
<TimelineItem 
  date="2025[October] - 2026[March]"
  title="DevOps Intern"
  company="Capgemini"
  description="Preparation by Capgemini for future DevOps projects"
/>
<TimelineItem 
  date="2025[March] - 2025[September]"
  title="Fullstack Developer"
  company="Freelance"
  description="Building an MVP — a recruitment platform with quizzes for candidates"
/>
<TimelineItem 
  date="2022[May] - 2024[April]"
  title="Frontend Developer"
  company="Thales"
  description="Building a GUI using Next.js and Tauri"
/>
    </div>
  </PuzzleSection>

</MainLayout>